                                "sense_id": "2cae535d-4e74-3e9a-8682-fb4fda42240c",
                                "text": "West Virginia Democratic Party Chair Mike Pushkin was not impressed with the executive orders, calling them a “troubling example” of executive overreach that “could harm us for generations.”"
